  "body": "Request: Add a way to promote a user as admin.\r\n\r\nThe current spec proposals e.g. mentioned in matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals#971 do not cover a way to add or remove admins for a group. It is currently possible with database fiddling but there should be an official way via API.\r\n\r\nThis is related to https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/2855",
